!! Reference Guides

<$ss.grid min="260px">

<$ss.card badge="Widgets" accent="var(--tpc-primary)">
<h3>[[$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/primitives|UI Primitives Reference]]</h3>
<p>Hero banners, responsive auto-fitting grids, content cards, property pills, and progress bars.</p>
<$button class="mn-pill-btn" to="$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/primitives">View Widgets &rarr;</$button>
</$ss.card>

<$ss.card badge="Ergonomics" accent="var(--tpc-accent, #3b82f6)">
<h3>[[$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/writing|Writing & Typography]]</h3>
<p>72ch reading column, outline extraction in the Right Inspector, fluid typography, and palettes.</p>
<$button class="mn-pill-btn" to="$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/writing">View Guide &rarr;</$button>
</$ss.card>

<$ss.card badge="Discovery" accent="var(--tpc-secondary, #10b981)">
<h3>[[$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/connections|Connections & Inspector]]</h3>
<p>Dynamic backlink discovery, document outline navigation, and mobile zoomin action sheet.</p>
<$button class="mn-pill-btn" to="$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/connections">View Guide &rarr;</$button>
</$ss.card>

<$ss.card badge="Extensibility" accent="var(--tpc-warning, #f59e0b)">
<h3>[[$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/customization|Customization Guide]]</h3>
<p>Pinned left nav shortcuts, custom inspector tabs, wide breakout mode, and mobile bottom bar.</p>
<$button class="mn-pill-btn" to="$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs/customization">View Guide &rarr;</$button>
</$ss.card>

</$ss.grid>

